DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       ppaammttooddjjvvuurrllee reads a Netpbm image (PNM or PAM equivalent of PNM) as in‐
       put and produces DjVu Color RLE format as output.


OOPPTTIIOONNSS
       In addition to the options common to all programs  based  on  libnetpbm
       (most notably --qquuiieett, see
        Common  Options  ⟨index.html#commonoptions⟩ ), ppaammttooddjjvvuurrllee recognizes
       the following command line option:



       --ttrraannssppaarreenntt _c_o_l_o_r_n_a_m_e
              This option indicates which color in the image should be consid‐
              ered transparent.

              Specify  the  color (_c_o_l_o_r) as described for the argument of the
              ppnnmm__ppaarrsseeccoolloorr(())                 library                 routine
              ⟨libnetpbm_image.html#colorname⟩ .

              Default is "white".



